the air so it levitates.

691
00:33:39,290 --> 00:33:41,420
so successful would be
you're watching up there

692
00:33:41,420 --> 00:33:45,030
and there's going to be a ball
up here, and it will levitate.

693
00:33:45,030 --> 00:33:47,080
Unsuccessful is I'll
have a black and white--

694
00:33:47,080 --> 00:33:49,680
a black and blue fingernail.

695
00:33:49,680 --> 00:33:50,540
So, let's see--

696
00:33:55,267 --> 00:33:56,350
