813
00:38:26,150 --> 00:38:28,950
The next example is pendulum.

814
00:38:28,950 --> 00:38:32,720
So just like spring
mass system, spring

815
00:38:32,720 --> 00:38:35,990
levitated mass in
a stable fashion,

816
00:38:35,990 --> 00:38:39,020
although perhaps oscillatory.

817
00:38:39,020 --> 00:38:44,420
So this pendulum is also
