818
00:38:44,420 --> 00:38:47,780
Might be oscillatory, but
it will eventually stop.

819
00:38:47,780 --> 00:38:49,910
Of course pendula are
not very interesting.

820
00:38:49,910 --> 00:38:51,670
What's interesting
