No that didn't work at all.

911
00:43:48,480 --> 00:43:51,020
So to think about
where are the poles you

912
00:43:51,020 --> 00:43:52,700
can think of-- the
hard part is just

913
00:43:52,700 --> 00:43:55,630
the sinusoidal
trigonometric non-linearity,

