00:44:07,720 --> 00:44:08,757
And the cos of theta is?

921
00:44:08,757 --> 00:44:09,340
AUDIENCE: One.

922
00:44:09,340 --> 00:44:10,330
DENNIS FREEMAN: One.

923
00:44:10,330 --> 00:44:13,240
For small angular deflections,
just make a small angle

